# spec356c-trackergrade.ref -- the PRE-DATA reference ledger read by spec356c-trackergrade.sh.
#
# THESE ARE THE VALUES THE GRADE IS MADE AGAINST, so they live in a committed file rather than in
# an invocation line: a reference typed at the keyboard makes the grade as strong as the operator's
# memory, which is an assertion and not a measurement. This file has its own digest, is pinned
# verbatim in spec356-manifest.md §10.0, and is the SAME bytes for the both-directions proof runs
# and for the real wave-5 run.
#
# Measured 2026-08-11, PRE-DATA, at pin feb85268952001813e502e27f65180855676ac25, against the live
# .specflow/todos/ files. `.specflow/` is gitignored (.gitignore:111) and NOT tracked, so these
# digests -- not a git diff -- are the only provenance those files have. R0.5 point 1.
#
# Format: <key><single space><value>; the value is the rest of the line VERBATIM (it may contain
# spaces, brackets and non-ASCII). Lines beginning # and empty lines are ignored.

todo634_pre_sha256 555c3aa92a569c030a7fbacfafdee5933bf4beda668d79fff126f1a2c0e74f8c
todo637_sha256 48a16fbdfa923770b673882ae58b7a1aa5f15e5a1d3b8a1ee36ce3142b02940f
